      "text": "template <typename T>\nstruct Box {\n    T value;\n};\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nusing Boxes = Box<T>[4];\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nT zero = T();\n\ntemplate <typename T>\nT unwrap(Box<T> box) {\n    return box.value;\n}\n\nint use() {\n    Box<int> box{1};\n    return unwrap(box) + zero<int>;\n}\n",
      "markers": []
    }
